WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.330
Welcome to AI Explorers.

00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:03.113
Middle-school learners practice stronger prompting,

00:00:03.233 --> 00:00:05.229
source-checking, privacy protection, and recognizing bias.

00:00:05.349 --> 00:00:07.011
Through collaboration and hands-on projects,

00:00:07.131 --> 00:00:10.125
students learn to question AI and use it thoughtfully.
